sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Streamlit/UI
    participant D as domain.py
    participant W as pipeline_worker.py
    participant P as Provider/helper
    participant S as JSON state
    UI->>D: create_tasks_for_batch()
    D->>S: tasks.json + queues.json
    loop worker tick
        W->>S: select to_do/doing task
        W->>W: resolve local-cascade stage
        alt valid artifact exists
            W->>S: persist transition and continue
        else artifact missing
            W->>P: execute current stage
            P-->>W: artifact or attributed error
            W->>S: atomic artifact + task update
        end
    end
    W-->>UI: heartbeat and progress
